OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly morning for many, with
OL,6,Fsome frost and isolated valley fog in
OL,7,Fprone spots. This will lead to a
OL,8,Fbright and sunny day with patchy
OL,9,Fafternoon cloud. The odd shower is
OL,10,Fpossible, most likely further east.
OL,11,FFeeling fresh.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine,
OL,14,Fthen clear spells after dark. Turning
OL,15,Fcloudier from the southeast overnight
OL,16,Fthough, with outbreaks of rain
OL,17,Farriving through the early hours,
OL,18,Fperhaps with some heavier bursts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
