OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA cloudy start to the new week
OL,6,Fwith patchy outbreaks of rain. These
OL,7,Fgradually clear, with skies turning
OL,8,Fbrighter through the morning, and some
OL,9,Fsunny spells developing for the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FUnsettled through Tuesday and
OL,14,FWednesday with cloudy skies, patchy
OL,15,Frain and a breeze at times. Some
OL,16,Fbrighter spells on Thursday, but with
OL,17,Fa few showers still possible. Perhaps
OL,18,Fwindy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
